column10:
Benefits

30 individually sealed cassettes and 30 tubes with 1.5mL each of dilution buffer;
Fast and reliable: results in only 10 minutes;
Sensitive: detects as little as 20ng/mL of human hemoglobin and 400 ng/mL of D-dimer;
Simple: easy to use, no special training necessary; and
Compatible with DNA extraction and typing.
